msgid ""
"Timidty is a MIDI-to-WAVE converter\n"
"but you can use this program as software\n"
"synthetiser.\n"
"TiMidity works purely as the software\n"
"real-time MIDI render, that is as a\n"
"software MIDI synth engine on ALSA."
msgstr ""
"Timidity is en MIDI-na-WAV-Wanneln,\n"
"man laat sik ok as Software-Klangteler\n"
"bruken.\n"
"Dat funkscheneert reen as en Echttiet-\n"
"Software-MIDI-Utgever, also as MIDI-\n"
"Klangteelkarn för ALSA."

